sequenceDiagram
    participant UI
    participant API as Evaluation API
    participant W as Worker
    participant DS as Data store
    participant LG as LLM Gateway
    UI->>API: POST /api/v2/datasets/{id}/generations {prompt, model, quantity/ratio, sampling order, dedupe}
    API-->>UI: 202 {id}
    W->>DS: Fetch total document count
    W->>W: Fix target count → sample global indices per the order → group by page
    loop Only pages containing samples
        W->>DS: Fetch document page
        loop Per sample in page
            alt Dedupe on + chunk already used
                W->>W: Skip — counted as duplicate
            else
                W->>LG: System prompt + extra instructions + chunk text
                LG-->>W: QnA JSON
                alt Schema validation passes
                    W->>W: Store generated item (source chunk = gold passage)
                else
                    W->>W: Retry → log an issue when exhausted
                end
            end
            W->>W: Update progress · token usage
        end
    end
    UI->>API: Review → apply selected items
    API->>API: Copy into dataset (duplicate check) + integrity-check trigger
